  "abstract": "Covers the OpenAPI Specification version lines: 3.2 (current, pinned at 3.2.1), 3.1 (supported, 3.1.2), 3.0 (supported, 3.0.4), Swagger 2.0 (legacy, upgraded from) and the 3.3 development line (preview, tracked at a v3.3-dev commit). It teaches document structure, paths, operations, parameters, streaming media types, tags, security schemes and requirements, the 2.0 to 3.0, 3.0 to 3.1 and 3.1 to 3.2 upgrades with the registered x-oai fallbacks, the OAI Extension and Namespace registries, and validation against the official OAS JSON Schemas. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, objects, security, registries, validation and drafts.",
